In standard $SU(5)$ notation, five of the fifteen left-handed fields fit into $\overline{\mathbf5}
=
\begin{pmatrix}
\nu_{eL}\\
e_L\\
d^c_{rL}\\
d^c_{gL}\\
d^c_{bL}
\end{pmatrix}.$ The order has been chosen as a weak two-dimensional block followed by a color three-dimensional block. Weak transformations mix the first two entries, color transformations mix the final three, and the off-diagonal $SU(5)$ generators connect the two blocks.

